---
import Layout from "../../Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Oviyam"
  description="Privacy policy for Oviyam, a local-first image library for Mac."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-xl space-y-6 px-4 pb-12">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="font-semibold text-2xl">Privacy Policy for Oviyam</h1>
      <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Last updated: August 14, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <p>
      Oviyam ("we", "our", or "us") is a local-first image library for Mac.
      Your image files stay under your control on your Mac.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Data Collection and Usage</h2>
      <p>
        Oviyam does not require an account and does not include cloud sync,
        uploads, analytics, advertising, or tracking. Your images and library
        activity are not sent to us or to third parties.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Access to Your Libraries</h2>
      <p>
        Oviyam accesses only library folders that you select. To reopen a
        registered library in later sessions, the app stores an app-scoped,
        persistent reference to that folder on your Mac.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        Your image files remain in their folders on disk. Oviyam keeps a local,
        rebuildable index and thumbnail cache on your Mac so it can display and
        search your libraries efficiently. These local records can be recreated
        from the files in your selected library folders.
      </p>
      <p>
        Forgetting a library in Oviyam removes only the app's saved reference to
        that folder. It does not delete, move, or change the folder or any of its
        contents.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be
        published on this page.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us
        at <a
          href="mailto:hello@praveenjuge.com"
          class="underline decoration-2 underline-offset-1"
        >
          hello@praveenjuge.com
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
